#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:1
msgid "Recording a filing, and why the tool never files for you"
msgstr "Registrar una presentación y por qué la herramienta nunca presenta por ti"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:3
msgid ""
"This page covers the last stretch of the journey: the line between the "
"work you do on your own computer and the real Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria (AEAT, the Spanish tax agency). The short "
"answer is that you file it yourself, and the tool keeps a careful record "
"around that act. This page is about why the boundary sits where it does."
msgstr ""
"Esta página trata el último tramo del recorrido: la línea entre el trabajo "
"que haces en tu propio ordenador y la Agencia Estatal de Administración "
"Tributaria real (AEAT, la agencia tributaria española). La respuesta breve "
"es que la presentas tú mismo, y la herramienta mantiene un registro "
"cuidadoso en torno a ese acto. Esta página trata de por qué la frontera está "
"donde está."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:9
msgid "The boundary is permanent"
msgstr "La frontera es permanente"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:11
msgid ""
"The tool can never submit a return, register anything, or change a single"
" value at the agency. This is not a cautious default you could switch off"
" later. There is no setting, no flag, and no expert mode that turns it "
"on. The submit path is built to refuse, every time, with a clear error "
"rather than a quiet attempt."
msgstr ""
"La herramienta nunca puede presentar una declaración, registrar nada ni "
"cambiar un solo valor en la Agencia. Esto no es un valor por defecto "
"prudente que pudieras desactivar más adelante. No hay ajuste, ni opción, ni "
"modo experto que lo active. La vía de presentación está construida para "
"negarse, siempre, con un error claro en lugar de un intento silencioso."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:13
msgid ""
"That refusal is deliberate. Filing a tax return is a legal act with your "
"name on it. A piece of software that could press the button on your "
"behalf would carry a risk you can never fully see. By making submission "
"impossible, the tool removes that risk entirely and keeps you in the "
"chair where the law expects you to be."
msgstr ""
"Esa negativa es deliberada. Presentar una declaración es un acto jurídico "
"con tu nombre. Un programa que pudiera pulsar el botón en tu lugar acarrearía "
"un riesgo que nunca puedes ver del todo. Al hacer imposible la presentación, "
"la herramienta elimina por completo ese riesgo y te mantiene en el asiento "
"en el que la ley espera que estés."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:15
msgid "Read-only access is the only connection"
msgstr "El acceso de solo lectura es la única conexión"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:17
msgid ""
"When you connect the tool to the agency, you grant it one thing: the "
"ability to read your own data from AEAT, view-only. It can look at the "
"returns you've already filed, the receipts on record, and the facts the "
"agency holds about you. It reads this so it can show it to you and "
"compare it against your local work."
msgstr ""
"Cuando conectas la herramienta con la Agencia, le concedes una sola cosa: la "
"capacidad de leer tus propios datos de la AEAT, solo de consulta. Puede ver "
"las declaraciones que ya has presentado, los justificantes registrados y los "
"datos que la Agencia tiene sobre ti. Lee esto para poder mostrártelo y "
"compararlo con tu trabajo local."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:19
msgid ""
"Nothing flows the other way. The connection has no path that writes, "
"edits, or registers. Reading your data, view-only, is the whole of what "
"it can do at the agency."
msgstr ""
"Nada fluye en sentido contrario. La conexión no tiene ninguna vía que "
"escriba, edite o registre. Leer tus datos, solo de consulta, es todo lo que "
"puede hacer en la Agencia."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:21
msgid "You upload the file yourself"
msgstr "El fichero lo subes tú mismo"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:23
msgid ""
"The real submission happens in your own browser, on the agency's website,"
" with your own login credentials - a digital certificate or Cl@ve (the "
"Spanish government's shared identity login). You sign in as yourself, you"
" upload the file the tool prepared, and you press submit. The tool never "
"holds your credentials for this and never stands between you and the "
"agency at that moment."
msgstr ""
"La presentación real ocurre en tu propio navegador, en la web de la Agencia, "
"con tus propias credenciales de acceso: un certificado digital o Cl@ve (el "
"sistema de identidad compartido del Gobierno de España). Te identificas como "
"tú mismo, subes el fichero que preparó la herramienta y pulsas presentar. La "
"herramienta nunca guarda tus credenciales para esto ni se interpone entre tú "
"y la Agencia en ese momento."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:25
msgid ""
"For the steps, see [Upload your exported modelo at the AEAT portal"
"](../how-to/file-at-aeat.md)."
msgstr ""
"Para los pasos, consulta [Sube tu modelo exportado en el portal de la AEAT]"
"(../how-to/file-at-aeat.md)."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:27
msgid "Recording a filing in your own records"
msgstr "Registrar una presentación en tus propios registros"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:29
msgid ""
"After you've uploaded the return yourself, you come back and mark that "
"saved version as final in your own history. This is recording that you've"
" filed - a local note in your own records, like writing \"sent\" next to "
"an invoice in your ledger."
msgstr ""
"Después de haber subido tú mismo la declaración, vuelves y marcas esa "
"versión guardada como definitiva en tu propio historial. Esto es registrar "
"que has presentado: una anotación local en tus propios registros, como "
"escribir «enviada» junto a una factura en tu ledger."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:31
msgid ""
"It changes nothing at the agency. It does not submit, re-send, or confirm"
" anything with AEAT. It marks one version as the answer you actually "
"filed, so that later, when you look back, you know which numbers went out"
" and when."
msgstr ""
"No cambia nada en la Agencia. No presenta, ni reenvía, ni confirma nada con "
"la AEAT. Marca una versión como la respuesta que realmente presentaste, para "
"que después, cuando eches la vista atrás, sepas qué cifras salieron y cuándo."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:33
msgid "Checking your record against the agency's receipt"
msgstr "Cotejar tu registro con el justificante de la Agencia"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:35
msgid ""
"When you file, the agency gives you a justificante - the official receipt"
" confirming what it received. The tool can compare your local figures "
"against that receipt to catch any disagreement. This is checking your "
"record against the agency's receipt."
msgstr ""
"Cuando presentas, la Agencia te da un justificante: el resguardo oficial que "
"confirma lo que recibió. La herramienta puede comparar tus cifras locales "
"con ese justificante para detectar cualquier discrepancia. Esto es cotejar "
"tu registro con el justificante de la Agencia."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:37
msgid ""
"The comparison reads only the receipt you supply. It does not contact the"
" agency to do its work. You hand it the justificante; it reports whether "
"your record matches, diverges, or doesn't line up with any receipt yet."
msgstr ""
"La comparación lee únicamente el justificante que aportas. No contacta con "
"la Agencia para hacer su trabajo. Le entregas el justificante; te informa de "
"si tu registro coincide, diverge o todavía no encaja con ningún justificante."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:39
msgid ""
"For the steps, see [Reconcile a filed modelo against its justificante"
"](../how-to/reconcile.md)."
msgstr ""
"Para los pasos, consulta [Concilia un modelo presentado con tu justificante]"
"(../how-to/reconcile.md)."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:41
msgid "What this comparison can and can't tell you"
msgstr "Qué puede y qué no puede decirte esta comparación"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:43
msgid ""
"The comparison confirms that your local record matches the receipt's "
"header fields - the modelo, the filing year, the period, and your tax ID "
"- and names any field that disagrees. It does not compare individual box "
"values, and it is not a live re-check of your maths against the agency: "
"none of these steps re-derives your tax; they confirm what was filed and "
"keep proof of it. The precise scope and the mismatch-handling steps are "
"in [Reconcile a filed modelo against its justificante](../how-"
"to/reconcile.md)."
msgstr ""
"La comparación confirma que tu registro local coincide con los campos de "
"cabecera del justificante —el modelo, el año de presentación, el periodo y "
"tu NIF— y nombra cualquier campo que no coincida. No compara los valores de "
"las casillas individuales, ni es una revisión en vivo de tus cálculos frente "
"a la Agencia: ninguno de estos pasos vuelve a calcular tu impuesto; "
"confirman lo que se presentó y conservan la prueba de ello. El alcance "
"exacto y los pasos para tratar las discrepancias están en [Concilia un "
"modelo presentado con tu justificante](../how-to/reconcile.md)."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:51
msgid "Where this sits in the journey"
msgstr "Dónde encaja esto en el recorrido"

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:53
msgid ""
"This is the end of the pipeline that the [overview](index.md) lays out. "
"Everything before it - building the modelo, checking it, recording the "
"result - is yours to do locally; this page is where that local work meets"
" the real agency, across a line the tool will not cross."
msgstr ""
"Este es el final del circuito que expone la [visión general](index.md). Todo "
"lo anterior —construir el modelo, comprobarlo, registrar el resultado— es "
"cosa tuya en local; esta página es donde ese trabajo local se encuentra con "
"la Agencia real, cruzando una línea que la herramienta no traspasará."

#: ../../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md:55
msgid ""
"If a comparison turns up a mismatch and you fix it, re-checking the "
"corrected version is covered in [Editing and verifying a calculation"
"](editing-and-verifying.md). And once a filing is recorded, it becomes "
"evidence the tool can lean on for later returns, which [How filings build"
" on earlier ones](building-on-earlier-filings.md) explains."
msgstr ""
"Si una comparación revela una discrepancia y la corriges, volver a comprobar "
"la versión corregida se explica en [Editar y verificar un cálculo](editing-"
"and-verifying.md). Y una vez registrada, una presentación se convierte en "
"evidencia en la que la herramienta puede apoyarse para declaraciones "
"posteriores, lo que explica [Cómo las presentaciones se apoyan en las "
"anteriores](building-on-earlier-filings.md)."
